TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 805623469}
  m_Text: 'OFFICE OF THE DIRECTOR OF CONTINUITY

    Re: Desk 3-114


    Three has not reconciled since Friday.

    Until it does, Facilities will go on numbering.

    Every door is to remain a door.

    Nothing is to be closed.


    T. Vane'
